 Zend/acinclude.m4      |  5 ++++-
 acinclude.m4           | 38 ++++++++++++++++++++------------------
 configure.in           | 11 ++++++-----
 ext/standard/config.m4 | 38 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++------------
 5 files changed, 61 insertions(+), 40 deletions(-)

